---
description: Prepare one recoverEventPromises evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: LiveEvent[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Reconcile agendas, contracts, accessibility needs, and participant communications to identify commitments that matter. Distinguish published promises from internal preferences and preserve dependencies such as travel, technical setup, and required access arrangements. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
